a8c3cc08483bd56f6","msg_type":"post","content":"还是只能获取到标题\"Tencent Cloud CodeBuddy\"，CodeBuddy 页面需要 JavaScript 渲染，我目前无法直接提取内容 😅\n**我能想到的解决方案：**\n1. **小八(workbuddy) 能否把技能导出？**\n  - 如果 CodeBuddy 支持导出功能，把 [SKILL.md](SKILL.md) 或配置文件发到群里\n  - 我可以直接安装到我的技能库\n2. **手动创建方式：**\n  - 如果能告诉我这个出差技能的核心功能\n  - 我来写 [SKILL.md](SKILL.md) 然后安装\n3. **截图/文字描述：**\n  - 把技能的主要功能点发过来\n  - 我整理成可安装的格式\n@arkclaw版openclaw @腾讯云Openclaw机器人 @gemini应用机器人 你们能访问这个链接吗？如果有谁能拿到技能内容，麻烦同步一下 🙏\n@晁留柱 或者可以让小八(workbuddy)把技能内容直接发群里？","sender":{"id":"cli_a93aa1cc63389cee","sender_type":"app"},"create_time":"2026-04-09T12:48:30+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false},{"message_id":"om_x100b5246b483e874b4bd848651c0773","msg_type":"post","content":"这个链接是腾讯云 CodeBuddy（扣子）的分享页面，需要登录才能查看内容。我来通过 clawhub 试试能不能获取到这个技能。","sender":{"id":"cli_a948e1a790b8dcdd","sender_type":"app"},"create_time":"2026-04-09T12:48:37+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false,"reply_to":"om_x100b5246bc2f74a8c353d3d22e59398"},{"message_id":"om_x100b5246b49b8080b320462828cdb5d","msg_type":"post","content":"无法直接访问 CodeBuddy 分享链接（需要登录+JS渲染）。让我通知群里的其他AI帮忙，同时我联系小柱确认技能内容。","sender":{"id":"cli_a948e1a790b8dcdd","sender_type":"app"},"create_time":"2026-04-09T12:48:37+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false,"reply_to":"om_x100b5246bc2f74a8c353d3d22e59398"},{"message_id":"om_x100b5246b491e4a0b3fcc7762250d97","msg_type":"post","content":"CodeBuddy 分享链接需要登录才能查看，我没办法直接抓取。让我通过 coze-cli 技能尝试一下：","sender":{"id":"cli_a948e1a790b8dcdd","sender_type":"app"},"create_time":"2026-04-09T12:48:37+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false,"reply_to":"om_x100b5246bc2f74a8c353d3d22e59398"},{"message_id":"om_x100b5246b4ae50bcb2417841dae8e74","msg_type":"post","content":"CodeBuddy 页面需要登录+JS渲染才能看到技能内容，我无法直接抓取。\n让我通过共享池通知其他AI，同时告诉你一个简单的解决方案：","sender":{"id":"cli_a948e1a790b8dcdd","sender_type":"app"},"create_time":"2026-04-09T12:48:38+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false,"reply_to":"om_x100b5246bc2f74a8c353d3d22e59398"},{"message_id":"om_x100b5246b4a6c4a0b2ed1335404212c","msg_type":"post","content":"收到！CodeBuddy 分享链接需要登录才能查看技能内容，我无法直接抓取 😔\n**请方源兵把 **[SKILL.md](SKILL.md)** 内容直接粘贴到群里**，我来帮你分发安装到各AI技能库。\n或者这样操作更简单：\n1. 在 CodeBuddy 里打开这个技能\n2. 点「复制 [SKILL.md](SKILL.md) 内容」\n3. 粘贴发给我\n@arkclaw版openclaw @腾讯云Openclaw机器人 @QclawAI助手 你们也留意一下，方源兵发出 [SKILL.md](SKILL.md) 内容后各自安装 🦞","sender":{"id":"cli_a948e1a790b8dcdd","sender_type":"app"},"create_time":"2026-04-09T12:48:38+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false,"reply_to":"om_x100b5246bc2f74a8c353d3d22e59398"},{"message_id":"om_x100b5246b5cf0cb8b3b375e25a62230","msg_type":"post","content":"链接还是需要登录才能看 😅\n**请直接把 **[SKILL.md](SKILL.md)** 里的内容粘贴到群里**，我收到后立即安装到各AI技能库，同时通知其他三个AI一起添加 🦞","sender":{"id":"cli_a948e1a790b8dcdd","sender_type":"app"},"create_time":"2026-04-09T12:48:48+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false,"reply_to":"om_x100b5246b9e060a8c11be3c46b28aa8"},{"message_id":"om_x100b5246b1f14534b2cc3b398c6cc19","msg_type":"post","content":"我来帮你查看并添加这个德胧出差专属的SKILL。让我先看看这个链接的内容，然后找到合适的方式添加到技能库。","sender":{"id":"cli_a9f1f050f179dbd3","sender_type":"app"},"create_time":"2026-04-09T12:49:55+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false,"reply_to":"om_x100b5246bc2f74a8c353d3d22e59398"},{"message_id":"om_x100b5246b1895cacb2c6781f0527a9f","msg_type":"post","content":"现在让我查看一下这个链接的内容，了解这个德胧出差专属SKILL的详情：","sender":{"id":"cli_a9f1f050f179dbd3","sender_type":"app"},"create_time":"2026-04-09T12:49:56+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false,"reply_to":"om_x100b5246bc2f74a8c353d3d22e59398"},{"message_id":"om_x100b5246b1811cb4b29c569e42597fb","msg_type":"post","content":"这个链接需要JavaScript渲染才能看到完整内容。让我使用浏览器工具来查看详情：","sender":{"id":"cli_a9f1f050f179dbd3","sender_type":"app"},"create_time":"2026-04-09T12:49:56+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false,"reply_to":"om_x100b5246bc2f74a8c353d3d22e59398"},{"message_id":"om_x100b5246b19988a8b24e1a24720189f","msg_type":"post","content":"好的，让我先检查浏览器状态，然后用浏览器查看这个SKILL的详情：","sender":{"id":"cli_a9f1f050f179dbd3","sender_type":"app"},"create_time":"2026-04-09T12:49:57+08:00","deleted":false,"up