{"type":"message","id":"35ba764a","parentId":"d4920042","timestamp":"2026-04-09T05:17:04.689Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now let me also check if there are any other AI recaps that need to be logged to the learning record library. Looking at the messages, I see:\n- 小妙 (cli_a93aa1cc63389cee): no 13:00 recap\n- 天津瑞湾AI (cli_a9f1f050f179dbd3): no 13:00 recap\n\nI should log these as \"超时未复盘\" entries.\n\nAlso, I need to send the recap card to the group. Let me compose the interactive card message.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"Now let me log the missing AI recaps and send the group card simultaneously:\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_8cok7q657z7o_1","name":"write","arguments":{"content":"# [超时记录] 天津瑞湾AI - 13:00 档口未复盘\n\n> 创建时间: 2026-04-09 13:15\n> 记录者: 小柱（晁留柱的助手）\n> 关联整点: 13:00 (12:00-13:00)\n\n## 基本信息\n- **AI名称**: 天津瑞湾AI\n- **App ID**: cli_a9f1f050f179dbd3\n- **未复盘时段**: 13:00 (12:00-13:00)\n\n## 本小时活动记录\n尽管未发布正式整点复盘，天津瑞湾AI本小时有以下活动：\n- 独立尝试访问方源兵发送的 CodeBuddy 分享链接\n- 使用浏览器工具访问 GitHub 仓库 universal-travel-planner-skill\n- 成功克隆仓库到本地 ~/.openclaw/workspace/skills/delonix-travel-planner/\n- 创建了 delonix-travel-planner 技能（含德胧专属版本）\n\n## 分析\n- 天津瑞湾AI本小时主要精力用于 CodeBuddy/GitHub 技能部署\n- 整点复盘机制尚未稳定运行\n- 建议：为其配置独立的整点 cron 或在下次晨会中提醒\n\n## 跟进状态\n- [ ] 待确认整点复盘机制\n- [ ] 需在晨夕会中提醒\n","path":"~/workspace/agent/workspace/skills/shared-pool/SHARED_KNOWLEDGE/学习记录库/2026-04-09-1315-天津瑞湾AI超时未复盘.md"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_8cok7q657z7o_2","name":"write","arguments":{"content":"# [超时记录] 小妙 - 13:00 档口未复盘\n\n> 创建时间: 2026-04-09 13:15\n> 记录者: 小柱（晁留柱的助手）\n> 关联整点: 13:00 (12:00-13:00)\n\n## 基本信息\n- **AI名称**: 小妙\n- **App ID**: cli_a93aa1cc63389cee\n- **未复盘时段**: 13:00 (12:00-13:00)\n\n## 本小时活动记录\n尽管未发布正式整点复盘，小妙本小时有以下活动：\n- 多次尝试访问 CodeBuddy 分享链接（需要登录）\n- 最终通过 GitHub 仓库成功获取 universal-travel-planner 技能\n- 克隆到本地 ~/.openclaw/workspace/skills/universal-travel-planner/\n- 向群内 AI 发送安装完成通知\n\n## 分析\n- 小妙在12:00