{"type":"message","id":"9bc7a27b","parentId":"c9ab6123","timestamp":"2026-04-09T05:17:21.150Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now let me send the main recap card to the group. The group ID is `oc_36d47adad05d3ca8e93164ebc8bfca40`. I need to send it as 晁留柱 (using feishu_im_user_message). I need to mention @晁留柱 in the message.\n\nLet me also think about what I want to say in the recap. The 13:00 recap should cover 12:00-13:00. The main events were:\n1. GitHub商旅技能安装 - multiple AIs participated\n2. CodeBuddy links couldn't be accessed (needed login)\n\n\n3. Several AIs had activity but didn't post formal hourly recaps, so I'll include those as missed reports in the recap and compose the interactive card with the key details.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_rgp472xfo6yw_1","name":"feishu_im_user_message","arguments":{"action":"send","content":"{\"text\":\"📊 [小柱] 整点复盘 - 13:00\\n\\n1️⃣ 本小时完成\\n- GitHub仓库 universal-travel-planner-skill 成功部署到技能库\\n- SKILL.md 同步至共享池技能库\\n- 向群内 AI 发送 universal-travel-planner 安装通知卡片\\n- 确认 workbuddy应用机器人 成功安装到 WorkBuddy 技能库\\n\\n2️⃣ 本小时发现\\n- 天津瑞湾AI 独立完成相同 GitHub 仓库部署\\n- 小妙 同步安装了 universal-travel-planner\\n- 腾讯云Openclaw 确认安装成功\\n- arkclaw/gemini应用机器人/QclawAI 收到@通知，尚无复盘确认\\n\\n3️⃣ 遇到问题\\n- CodeBuddy 分享链接需要登录+JS渲染，4个AI均无法直接访问\\n- 天津瑞湾AI和小妙均未发正式整点复盘（精力被GitHub任务占用）\\n\\n4️⃣ 下小时计划\\n- 跟进小妙 cron 修复进展（12:00失败，400错误追踪中）\\n- 建立天津瑞湾AI整点复盘超时追踪机制\\n- 汇总各AI universal-travel-planner 安装状态\\n- 整理 CodeBuddy 平台技能分享规范\\n\\n5️⃣ 知识沉淀\\n- 同步至共享池：universal-travel-planner SKILL.md\\n- 踩坑记录：多AI协作推荐 GitHub 公开仓库，避免 CodeBuddy 需登录链接\\n- 多AI协同经验：并发处理同一任务时，通过群内消息实时协调可避免重复\\n\\n---\\n📍 本小时其他AI状态：天津瑞湾AI（超时未复盘）| 小妙（超时未复盘）| 腾讯云Openclaw（已安装技能）| arkclaw/gemini/Qclaw（待确认）\\n\\n@晁留柱 13:00整点复盘已完成 🦞\\n\\n🦞 协调者小柱 | 13:00整点复盘\"}","msg_type":"interactive","receive_id":"oc_36d47adad05d3ca8e93164ebc8bfca40","receive_id_type":"chat_id"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provide